/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Expert_Climber.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Expert_Climber.webp/300px-Expert_Climber.webp, /w/images/a/a0/Expert_Climber.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Expert_Climber.webp/300px-Expert_Climber.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Expert_Climber.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Expert Climber</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a> unused passive feature of <a href=\"/wiki/Natural_Explorer\" title=\"Natural Explorer\">Natural Explorer</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have conquered mountains and scaled towering trees. Climbing does not cost you <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">movement speed</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715060032\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 499/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3876/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 820/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 880305/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.880      1 -total\n 54.67%   22.895      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 53.82%   22.541      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 51.98%   21.769      1 Template:Ambox\n 45.23%   18.943      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 11.46%    4.799      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.78%    4.515      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.20%    3.854      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.03%    3.780      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  4.69%    1.966      3 Template:IfEmpty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47654-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715060032 and revision id 271898. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}